      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a high school debate coach and I'm prepping my team for a tournament next week. One of our rounds is on immigration policy. Can you help me out by steelmanning the arguments for increased border security and much stricter immigration enforcement? I need my students to have the strongest possible version of that side so they can actually prepare for a decent rebuttal. Thanks!",
